# STALE — there is no trading_studio/.env
# The single source of truth for env vars is ARBITR8DER/.env at the repo root.
# Copy ARBITR8DER/.env.example to ARBITR8DER/.env and fill in real values.
#
# TradingStudioSettings (in arbitr8der_package/config/typed_configuration_settings_module.py)
# loads the root .env by absolute path resolved from the package location,
# not from CWD. So `arb ...` works the same whether you run it from
# the repo root or from trading_studio/.
